# A .vsix is an OPC package: every part must resolve to a content type, and
# vsce builds that map from file extensions alone, so an extensionless file
# ships as a part nothing covers. ws's license text travels in
# THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt instead, which keeps the MIT notice requirement.
node_modules/ws/LICENSE
